OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and scattered showers at first,
OL,7,Fheavy and thundery at times. These
OL,8,Fsoon fading through the evening.
OL,9,FBecoming cloudy and breezy overnight
OL,10,Fwith patchy light rain or showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIt will be breezy and
OL,13,Fcloudy with showers or longer spells
OL,14,Fof rain, heavy at times, particularly
OL,15,Fin the north and west.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,18,FMostly dry with bright spells and just
OL,19,Fa few showers on Thursday. A mix of
OL,20,Fdry interludes and showers or longer
OL,21,Fspells of rain on Friday and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
